WEBVTT

00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:30.727
And I remember going to work at times,

00:01:30.751 --> 00:01:32.974
feeling like there was
so much to figure out

00:01:32.998 --> 00:01:35.180
and not always sure
who I could be open with

00:01:35.204 --> 00:01:37.556
about the fact that
I didn't know certain things

00:01:37.580 --> 00:01:41.856
or that I was uncertain about
how to proceed with a patient.

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:45.986
I wasn't sure that I could be
vulnerable and open with people.

00:01:46.010 --> 00:01:47.652
And that felt quite lonely.

00:01:49.620 --> 00:01:52.057
And I struggled with that

00:01:52.081 --> 00:01:55.571
until one particular moment
a couple of years in,

00:01:55.595 --> 00:01:59.776
when I ended up sick,
as I think I've ever been.

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:02.863
And it was during those five days